      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Just four left after scratchings. ALL BUSINESS (6) broke through for a solid win last time out at Caulfield Heath. Wasn't the strongest field but finds another winnable race now and she can win again. MR SIOUX (8) is only having his fourth start and open to plenty of improvement. He won his maiden on very heavy going at Warrnambool two back then was okay at Mornington onto good. Not sure about synthetic for him but he's got upside. ROCK THEM JOOLS (7) ran well fresh at Mornington and should be fitter, he'll sit off them and try to sprint best. TWO WOLVES (4) will find this a bit easier than two runs back and away from wet ground could help too. Not much between the quartet.",
